/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_1417899129923258_839030610360296439_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qITq1yI3x00Q7kNvwEEf9X9&_nc_oc=AdrRhws5mTe152gvnXL3RntvqKS5L5V15ux7eg9nPJ6olV6I1f9S62BezST3tkf24lk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJGqRev8v9o7Q8x52F50b4WoEebErctOWmptEpn9sjK-g&oe=6AA57713"}, {"file_name": "ChimplowPrefix_2026-01-21_19-23-32.png", "id": "25729362983417149", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822550_25729362993417148_8989315010413837752_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NVzJ7qiToykQ7kNvwFj3WEE&_nc_oc=AdpjH1re66SgPjO1wAKbOm6RP3Wj1PHHeL1Y8QZiVtGaHS_U3O5pJKVDH3bZA1qis-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK2YaCJT4waV574Ox5QuJrTl70nN1Hpb6qKfNYGf_nhTQ&oe=6AA56D1C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Chimplow", "keywords": ["fun", "chill", "horror", "parkour", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "Step into Chimplow, a vibrant VR world packed with variety and fun! Switch between game modes like Horror for thrilling scares, Deathrun to test your agility, or simply Chill to relax and explore amazing environments. Play solo or with friends in immersive multiplayer worlds. Complete challenges, jump, run, explore, and laugh together. With endless mini-games and activities, Chimplow offers something for everyone\u2014adventure, excitement, or just a place to hang out in VR. Dive in and create your own VR experience!", "short_description": "Dive into Chimplow, a VR world with multiple game modes! Survive the scares in Horror, race through Deathrun, or just chill and explore with friends. Play solo or multiplayer, enjoy fast-paced challenges, relaxing environments, and endless VR fun. Your adventure, your rules, all in one immersive VR experience!"}]}, "developer_name": "AYS.VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ays-production.webnode.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ays.p